","text":"Create a system such as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Character progression","XP","skill tree"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Show:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design objectives"},{"text":"Rules"},{"text":"Formula"},{"text":"Economy"},{"text":"Balance testing"},{"text":"Player progression"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Game Economy"},{"type":"p","text":"Design:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Currency"},{"text":"Rewards"},{"text":"Costs"},{"text":"Progression"},{"text":"Sinks"},{"text":"Sources"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use spreadsheets to demonstrate balancing."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Game UX"},{"type":"p","text":"Design:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tutorial"},{"text":"HUD"},{"text":"Menu"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Onboarding"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Test with actual players."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Team Game"},{"type":"p","text":"This is extremely valuable."},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programmer"},{"text":"Artist"},{"text":"Animator"},{"text":"Sound designer"},{"text":"Producer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document exactly what you designed."},{"type":"p","text":"Recruiters want to see collaboration, not only solo prototypes."}]},{"heading":"Playtesting Is Essential","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A common student mistake is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I think my game is fun.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Professional design asks:"},{"type":"h","text":"“What does the evidence from players tell us?”"},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Playtests"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Player interviews"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Difficulty testing"},{"text":"Retention analysis"},{"text":"Task completion analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Where players get stuck"},{"text":"Where they quit"},{"text":"What they misunderstand"},{"text":"Which mechanics they ignore"},{"text":"Which mechanics they enjoy"},{"text":"Di