{"text":"Internship opportunities"},{"text":"Graduate employment"},{"text":"Specialisations"}]}]},{"heading":"AI and the Future of Game Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will significantly change game development."},{"type":"h","text":"AI can assist with"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Game concept exploration"},{"text":"NPC dialogue generation"},{"text":"Procedural content"},{"text":"Level variations"},{"text":"Game balancing experiments"},{"text":"Player behaviour analysis"},{"text":"Automated playtesting"},{"text":"Quest variations"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Asset ideation"},{"text":"Voice and dialogue workflows"},{"text":"Game localisation"},{"text":"Live-game analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Generative Game Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Games may dynamically generate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Levels"},{"text":"Missions"},{"text":"Dialogue"},{"text":"Characters"},{"text":"Environments"},{"text":"Challenges"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-driven NPCs"},{"type":"p","text":"Future games may use AI-driven characters that:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Remember player interactions"},{"text":"Adapt dialogue"},{"text":"Change behaviour"},{"text":"Respond dynamically"},{"text":"Generate context-aware missions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Human designers remain critical"},{"type":"p","text":"AI does not remove the need for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Game vision"},{"text":"Player psychology"},{"text":"Design judgement"},{"text":"Balance"},{"text":"Narrative coherence"},{"text":"Ethical decisions"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Cultural sensitivity"},{"text":"Fun and emotional experience"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future designer will be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Designer","Systems Thinker","Player Researcher","AI Collaborator"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Future Game Design Roles","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By 2030–2045, possible specialised roles include:"},